    "name": "Isoterra",
    "steam_appid": 3436430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isoterra is(will be) an Isometric 2D (blocky) Sandbox Open World RPG game in which you have to survive by fighting your way to the farthest zones of the world to combat corruption.  <br><br>Build bases and outposts, gather resources, craft items, train skills, rescue NPCs and fight for your survival. But be careful, the farther you explore this infinite world the more dangerous and rewarding it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isoterra is still in early development and I'm still prototyping everything</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft blocks from the world and use them to build your own Base or Zone Outpost to feel like home for you and for the NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/1862df3b8812943bb2f507d1c93daa5e.avif?t=1737390208\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining/Digging</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just build up, but also dig down into tunnels and caves to explore and find ore veins to mine and enemies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/20e2176fc63cf1d2ae0f5cc2dd3acc64.avif?t=1737390208\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 13 skills to discover divided in 4 main type:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Melee, Range, Magic, Taming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering</strong>: Mining, Woodcutting, Fishing, Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production</strong>: Cooking, Alchemy, Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility</strong>: Slayer, Artisan</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and rescue NPCs that will provide benefits to you when they move to your base, this benefits could be unique items for crafting or unlocking a Skill.<br><br>Farther Zones will have high tier NPCs selling high Tiear Items</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between 3 combat styles: Melee, Range Magic in combat better adapt to the fight situation.<br><br>Equip different types of weapons and armor and preset them to a combat style so when switching to it they'll automatically be equipped.<br><br>Each weapon will provide 3 unique abilities to combine with the other abilities from the other combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.poster.avif?t=1737390208\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.webm?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.mp4?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/d0feaf64dc3077f8341ce4b17e189b48.poster.avif?t=1737390208\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/d0feaf64dc3077f8341ce4b17e189b48.webm?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/d0feaf64dc3077f8341ce4b17e189b48.mp4?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse into a procedurally generated world with 4 biomes (more to come on the future) and 4 Zones.<br><br>Progress through the Zones: Blue, Yellow, Red and Black which are concentric circles starting from spawn and each one is more dangerous than the one before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And much more!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleporting systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clue Scrolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bestiary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection Log</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isoterra is(will be) an Isometric 2D (blocky) Sandbox Open World RPG game in which you have to survive by fighting your way to the farthest zones of the world to combat corruption.  <br><br>Build bases and outposts, gather resources, craft items, train skills, rescue NPCs and fight for your survival. But be careful, the farther you explore this infinite world the more dangerous and rewarding it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isoterra is still in early development and I'm still prototyping everything</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft blocks from the world and use them to build your own Base or Zone Outpost to feel like home for you and for the NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/1862df3b8812943bb2f507d1c93daa5e.avif?t=1737390208\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining/Digging</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just build up, but also dig down into tunnels and caves to explore and find ore veins to mine and enemies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/20e2176fc63cf1d2ae0f5cc2dd3acc64.avif?t=1737390208\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 13 skills to discover divided in 4 main type:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Melee, Range, Magic, Taming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering</strong>: Mining, Woodcutting, Fishing, Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production</strong>: Cooking, Alchemy, Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility</strong>: Slayer, Artisan</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and rescue NPCs that will provide benefits to you when they move to your base, this benefits could be unique items for crafting or unlocking a Skill.<br><br>Farther Zones will have high tier NPCs selling high Tiear Items</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between 3 combat styles: Melee, Range Magic in combat better adapt to the fight situation.<br><br>Equip different types of weapons and armor and preset them to a combat style so when switching to it they'll automatically be equipped.<br><br>Each weapon will provide 3 unique abilities to combine with the other abilities from the other combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.poster.avif?t=1737390208\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.webm?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/0a3524bc3b9e59c794cdcb5498c4711d.mp4?t=1737390208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436430/extras/d0feaf64dc3077f8341ce4b17e189b48.poster.avif?t=1737390208\" width=800 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/